 "source": "IRAS. Conditions apply, incl. no other home bought in between.",
 "caption": "Bought your next home before selling your first? You pay 20% ABSD upfront: $360,000 on a $1.8M condo. 🏠\n\nMarried couples with at least one Singapore Citizen can get it refunded if they sell their first home within 6 months: from the purchase date for a completed home, or from TOP or completion (whichever is earlier) if buying off plan.\n\nMiss the deadline and the refund is gone.\n\nSave this 👇\n\nIRAS rules apply, including that no other residential property is bought in between.",
